Dialogue: 3,0:00:02.19,0:00:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For you to so easily forget something I've given you...
Dialogue: 3,0:00:06.69,0:00:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,is punishable by death, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:09.44,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to forgive you, even if you apologize.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:14.45,0:00:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I did come chasing after you to make fun of you, though.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:23.41,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get hit by a car or something?
Dialogue: 3,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something over there that resembles your precious bike,
Dialogue: 3,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,which is pretty beaten up, or should I say, rammed into a telephone pole.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:34.51,0:00:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you were hit by a convoy of trucks, how would that happen?
Dialogue: 3,0:00:38.14,0:00:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just fell on my own.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:41.77,0:00:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on the phone, pedaling,
Dialogue: 3,0:00:44.77,0:00:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and I ended up crashing into the telephone pole.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:47.61,0:00:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:48.86,0:00:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But for you to crash into a sturdy concrete wall with enough force to destroy it,
Dialogue: 3,0:00:53.74,0:00:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and end up with merely these wounds,
Dialogue: 3,0:00:56.82,0:00:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,is rather commendable, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:59.66,0:01:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you don't need an ambulance?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:02.58,0:01:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be able to move again after I rest a bit.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:06.58,0:01:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:07.71,0:01:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll do you a big favor.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:15.84,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Think happy thoughts until you're able to move around again.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on in, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:22.27,0:03:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's a little messy.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:24.61,0:03:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to hold back, you know.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:26.50,0:03:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I really admire that you're sensitive enough to hesitate before entering the room of a girl you barely know,
Dialogue: 3,0:03:32.85,0:03:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's probably not the best time to be worrying about that.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:35.37,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 3,0:03:42.25,0:03:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:43.42,0:03:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 3,0:03:44.38,0:03:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One hour{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}no, thirty minutes is fine...
Dialogue: 3,0:03:47.76,0:03:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me some time to clean up this room.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:50.48,0:03:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:01.56,0:04:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 3,0:04:02.75,0:04:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,where should I start, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 3,0:04:06.43,0:04:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate,
Dialogue: 3,0:04:08.22,0:04:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,please allow me to apologize for last night.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:11.69,0:04:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 3,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, that {\i1}was{\i0} you...
Dialogue: 3,0:04:16.22,0:04:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying things like "like I thought"
Dialogue: 3,0:04:17.54,0:04:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,really makes you sound irritated, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You completely saw through it, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:04:22.99,0:04:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you didn't,
Dialogue: 3,0:04:24.27,0:04:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then there's no way you'd come to talk to me.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:27.63,0:04:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really,
Dialogue: 3,0:04:29.23,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it was just a guess.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:30.84,0:04:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to my conclusion based on your build, outline, and silhouette.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:34.50,0:04:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I also considered who'd know about my study session with Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:38.47,0:04:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I searched after narrowing it down with those factors.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:41.77,0:04:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think of it like that, well, yeah...
Dialogue: 3,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice insight.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:46.85,0:04:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that there are guys who can differentiate girls based on their waists...
Dialogue: 3,0:04:51.37,0:04:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,can you do that too?
Dialogue: 3,0:04:55.66,0:04:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:57.21,0:04:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't my intention...
Dialogue: 3,0:04:59.10,0:05:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, even if you apologize...
Dialogue: 3,0:05:01.26,0:05:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What I really want to know is the reason.
Dialogue: 3,0:05:04.22,0:05:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, even more than the reason, that power...
Dialogue: 3,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ask about that superhuman strength...
Dialogue: 3,0:05:09.38,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you...
Dialogue: 3,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess if I was to start somewhere,
Dialogue: 3,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it'd have to be from there...
Dialogue: 3,0:05:18.56,0:05:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 3,0:05:21.25,0:05:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, first I'd like to ask you
Dialogue: 3,0:05:26.59,0:05:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're the type of person that can believe in things that seem crazy.
Dialogue: 3,0:05:29.68,0:05:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Things that seem crazy?
Dialogue: 3,0:05:32.29,0:05:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not get it?
Dialogue: 3,0:05:34.45,0:05:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, I'm asking if you can believe in what you see with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 3,0:05:44.46,0:05:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in anything but what I've seen with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 3,0:05:47.85,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come this far believing everything that I've seen.
Dialogue: 3,0:05:52.72,0:05:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes what happened to Senjougahara, too, of course.
Dialogue: 3,0:05:55.97,0:05:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you had that figured out too?
Dialogue: 3,0:05:58.76,0:06:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, from the track and field club, and you, from the basketball club,
Dialogue: 3,0:06:02.54,0:06:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,were called the Valhalla Combination, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 3,0:06:06.67,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm surprised you even know about that, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:10.80,0:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where it comes from, too.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:12.22,0:06:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a well thought out name.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:14.05,0:06:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it? I thought of it.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:17.72,0:06:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She thought of it herself...
Dialogue: 3,0:06:20.47,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've felt this miserable.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:24.04,0:06:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, putting the Valhalla Combination aside,
Dialogue: 3,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-senpai and I have always, since middle school...
Dialogue: 3,0:06:30.96,0:06:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 3,0:06:32.79,0:06:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I talk anymore about that,
Dialogue: 3,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,there's something I need you to look at.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:39.79,0:06:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's not something I really want others to see.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:43.92,0:06:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I am still a girl.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is it...
Dialogue: 3,0:07:00.41,0:07:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 3,0:07:01.81,0:07:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,a monkey's paw...
Dialogue: 3,0:07:04.10,0:07:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, you really have unfathomably discerning eyes.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:07.81,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed. Being able to tell what this is with just a glance... there's no word for how surprising that is.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop deciding everything I do is impressive!
Dialogue: 3,0:07:15.61,0:07:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you my impressions of what I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:18.01,0:07:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:19.26,0:07:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 3,0:07:20.91,0:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Monkey's Paw{\i0} is the title of a short story by William Wymark Jacobs.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:25.82,0:07:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's said that it grants the owner's wishes, but in a way that conflicts with what they really intended.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:32.95,0:07:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Being able to see the truth behind this without knowing anything,
Dialogue: 3,0:07:36.78,0:07:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but think you're chosen by someone in heaven!
Dialogue: 3,0:07:42.55,0:07:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is it okay if I touch it?
Dialogue: 3,0:07:44.91,0:07:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine right now.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:47.71,0:07:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's alive.{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:01.30,0:08:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the living type of aberration after all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:06.98,0:08:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make weird noises!
Dialogue: 3,0:08:08.77,0:08:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you touched it weirdly!
Dialogue: 3,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not touch it weirdly!
Dialogue: 3,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ticklish.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:15.64,0:08:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, don't make sounds that completely change impressions of you!
Dialogue: 3,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:22.42,0:08:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, it moves how I want it to right now,
Dialogue: 3,0:08:25.73,0:08:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are times when it won't.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:29.00,0:08:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not quite right.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:29.99,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should say it moves {\i1}against{\i0} my will.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:33.16,0:08:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Against{\i0} your will?
Dialogue: 3,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not really my will, but...
Dialogue: 3,0:08:36.46,0:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I guess this is hard to understand.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:38.80,0:08:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 3,0:08:40.38,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the one who attacked you last night was definitely me,
Dialogue: 3,0:08:44.11,0:08:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have no recollection of it, for the most part.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:46.91,0:08:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was as if I was half asleep, or half dreaming...
Dialogue: 3,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I don't remember it at all, but...
Dialogue: 3,0:08:52.12,0:08:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Trance...
Dialogue: 3,0:08:53.41,0:08:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's called a trance.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:55.81,0:08:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know about it.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:57.15,0:09:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The type of aberration that manipulates human works by desynchronizing the body and the mind.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:02.29,0:09:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really know a lot, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:04.56,0:09:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So it's called an aberration.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:07.65,0:09:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like I know that much about it either.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:11.15,0:09:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why, but lately I've been experiencing things like that a lot.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:14.94,0:09:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's this guy that knows a lot about that stuff.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:19.38,0:09:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:20.86,0:09:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're an understanding person.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:23.45,0:09:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have been able to have this conversation if you'd run away after seeing my arm.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I probably would've been hurt a little, too.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I really was a bit surprised.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:33.52,0:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you told me the most surprising part to start off with,
Dialogue: 3,0:09:36.28,0:09:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fairly confident that I won't be surprised by anything you tell me now.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:39.78,0:09:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 3,0:09:40.77,0:09:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's exactly the reason I showed you my arm first.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:43.99,0:09:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You got through the most difficult part at the very beginning.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:47.62,0:09:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I think I'll get on to the real topic then.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:51.40,0:09:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a lesbian.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:55.85,0:10:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that might've been a bit blunt, since you're a guy.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 3,0:10:01.54,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me rephrase it: I'm a homose-
Dialogue: 3,0:10:03.59,0:10:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are exactly the same!
Dialogue: 3,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?! What do you mean?
Dialogue: 3,0:10:06.47,0:10:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying that you and Senjougahara were known as the Valhalla Combination in middle school,
Dialogue: 3,0:10:09.39,0:10:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and Senjougahara refers to you as {\i1}that girl{\0},
Dialogue: 3,0:10:13.93,0:10:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and she said yesterday that she'd never broken up with a {\i1}guy{\i0} before...
Dialogue: 3,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that you mean...?!
Dialogue: 3,0:10:18.31,0:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:19.40,0:10:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-senpai was my unrequited love.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:24.67,0:10:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, Senjougahara-senpai is pure and perfect.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:29.20,0:10:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She was someone I adored.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:31.28,0:10:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was satisfied by just being near her.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:35.22,0:10:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-senpai was popular with everyone,
Dialogue: 3,0:10:38.83,0:10:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think my feelings stood apart compared to those people.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:44.13,0:10:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confident about that.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:45.68,0:10:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I even thought that I could die for Senjougahara-senpai's sake.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:50.43,0:10:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 3,0:10:51.57,0:10:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-senpai changed.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:55.02,0:10:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She became different.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:57.55,0:11:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heard that she fell ill after she got to high school.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:01.67,0:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd also heard that she stopped track and field because of a prolonged illness.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:05.23,0:11:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd never have thought she'd change that much.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:08.99,0:11:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was just a bad rumor.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:13.63,0:11:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was even worse than the rumor.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:15.93,0:11:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There was something much more alarming happening to her body.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:20.71,0:11:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I realized that, I knew I had to do something.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:24.50,0:11:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I had to save her.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:28.42,0:11:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's natural, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 3,0:11:29.92,0:11:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We were in different clubs and different classes in middle school,
Dialogue: 3,0:11:33.43,0:11:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but she treated me really kindly.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:37.73,0:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this time,
Dialogue: 3,0:11:38.98,0:11:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who tried to save her.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:42.23,0:11:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I could do something about her problem.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:45.98,0:11:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I couldn't, I could be by her side and heal her heart.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:51.70,0:11:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hopelessly rejected.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:58.54,0:12:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't even think of you as an underclassman, let alone as a friend."
Dialogue: 3,0:12:02.25,0:12:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Not now and not ever."
Dialogue: 3,0:12:03.80,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that clearly to me.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:06.13,0:12:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So from then on, I've kept my distance from her.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:11.34,0:12:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Since that was the one and only thing she had ever wanted from me...
Dialogue: 3,0:12:17.61,0:12:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I couldn't forget about her...
Dialogue: 3,0:12:22.72,0:12:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that would save her even the tiniest bit,
Dialogue: 3,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,then I could accept it.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:32.17,0:12:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 3,0:12:32.97,0:12:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But a year went by, and I found out about you.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:38.58,0:12:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You were talking to her one morning quite closely in the classroom.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:44.21,0:12:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even during middle school, she'd never talked to me with that kind of...
Dialogue: 3,0:12:48.50,0:12:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,happy smile.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:52.00,0:12:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?!
Dialogue: 3,0:12:53.30,0:12:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were doing something that I really, really wanted to do, but had given up on
Dialogue: 3,0:12:58.51,0:13:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,like it was perfectly natural!
Dialogue: 3,0:12:58.51,0:12:59.47,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 3,0:13:00.48,0:13:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that was...
Dialogue: 3,0:13:02.57,0:13:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I was jealous.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:05.37,0:13:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to rethink my feelings,
Dialogue: 3,0:13:07.47,0:13:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end, I was still jealous of you.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:09.98,0:13:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered why I wasn't good enough.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered if it would be different if I were a guy.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered if it was because I was a girl.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:17.35,0:13:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she didn't need an underclassman or even a friend,
Dialogue: 3,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but wanted a lover.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:21.45,0:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If that was the case, why couldn't it be me?!
Dialogue: 3,0:13:25.92,0:13:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was jealous of you, and I was disappointed with her.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:30.18,0:13:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was on the verge of giving up on someone like myself.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:33.58,0:13:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell with healing her pain... to hell with keeping my distance from her...
Dialogue: 3,0:13:37.30,0:13:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I seriously thinking that she was going to praise me for doing that?!
Dialogue: 3,0:13:41.27,0:13:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 3,0:13:42.33,0:13:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I be that hypocritical?!
Dialogue: 3,0:13:44.58,0:13:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 3,0:13:45.65,0:13:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then...
Dialogue: 3,0:13:47.18,0:13:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted her to treat me kindly like she used to...
Dialogue: 3,0:13:52.02,0:13:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just selfish, but I want to be near her no matter what.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:55.99,0:13:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why...
Dialogue: 3,0:13:59.14,0:14:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why I asked this paw to grant my wish.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:01.66,0:14:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be by her side.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:12.58,0:14:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So that person's name is Oshino Meme?
Dialogue: 3,0:14:16.17,0:14:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is "Meme" written in katakana?
Dialogue: 3,0:14:17.52,0:14:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:18.65,0:14:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, he's not as cute as his name suggests.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:22.30,0:14:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry, the sun will set before we get there.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:25.92,0:14:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your left hand is dangerous at night, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:14:28.34,0:14:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, though really, it's actually that there's no problem when the sun is out.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:32.77,0:14:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At least for the next few hours, it should be fine.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:36.88,0:14:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, there's one thing I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:40.43,0:14:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 3,0:14:41.44,0:14:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of Senjougahara-senpai captivated you?
Dialogue: 3,0:14:46.60,0:14:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, she was your classmate for over two years, and you guys never even talked.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:51.80,0:14:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Why would you ask that?
Dialogue: 3,0:14:56.40,0:15:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, if you're after her body, I think I can be of service instead.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:04.29,0:15:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm fairly cute.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:08.50,0:15:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let my hair grow a little bit, I think I'd be a bit more girly,
Dialogue: 3,0:15:12.37,0:15:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and I also maintain my skin well.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:14.20,0:15:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I've been playing sports for a long time.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:17.14,0:15:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My waist is just narrow enough, and my body is nice and tight overall.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:23.79,0:15:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm completely serious.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:25.67,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish so,
Dialogue: 3,0:15:27.92,0:15:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the bottom to your top anytime, anywhere.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:31.65,0:15:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Top...?! Bottom...?!
Dialogue: 3,0:15:33.26,0:15:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would I wish for that?!
Dialogue: 3,0:15:36.94,0:15:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You don't know anything about BL.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:40.94,0:15:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's surprising.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:41.66,0:15:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to talk about BL with an underclassman girl!
Dialogue: 3,0:15:44.89,0:15:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,BL is short for boys' love, you know.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:47.07,0:15:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! I'm not misunderstanding you!
Dialogue: 3,0:15:49.84,0:15:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I noticed it when I was cleaning her room.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:55.05,0:15:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not misunderstanding me?
Dialogue: 3,0:15:57.33,0:16:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what exactly are you angry about, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 3,0:16:01.66,0:16:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you like the bottom!
Dialogue: 3,0:16:03.96,0:16:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 3,0:16:04.63,0:16:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This conversation is over!
Dialogue: 3,0:16:06.13,0:16:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for being intrusive, Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 3,0:16:09.84,0:16:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think that you won't survive in the world
Dialogue: 3,0:16:13.47,0:16:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,if you can't even enjoy a dirty conversation with an underclassman girl.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:15.47,0:16:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't want to be counseled by an underclassman girl.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:18.22,0:16:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you say that, Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 3,0:16:20.82,0:16:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it's problematic that you desire chaste girls when that desire is based on unfounded fantasies.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:26.85,0:16:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:28.23,0:16:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even girls are interested in talking about dirty stuff.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:33.13,0:16:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you can go ahead and continue telling me whether you wear boxers or briefs.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:38.37,0:16:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said anything about that.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:40.59,0:16:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 3,0:16:41.47,0:16:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Were we talking about whether or not I'm wearing panties under my spats?
Dialogue: 3,0:16:47.23,0:16:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aren't you wearing them?! Kanbaru-san!{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:16:50.56,0:16:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So under the spats coming out from the bottom of your skirt is...
Dialogue: 3,0:16:53.84,0:16:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if that was the case, there's no need to be surprised, is there?
Dialogue: 3,0:16:57.73,0:17:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Spats were originally intended to be lingerie, you know.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:00.49,0:17:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all the more of a reason!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:03.27,0:17:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the same as flashing your underwear around every day?!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:06.85,0:17:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, if you put it that way, I suppose it's true.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:09.73,0:17:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess for the time being
Dialogue: 3,0:17:11.73,0:17:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll just say it was a stylish present from this sports-loving girl.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:14.40,0:17:15.45,Alternative,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:15.45,0:17:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just plain exhibitionist perversion!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:17.23,0:17:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, now I remember!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:19.03,0:17:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what we were talking about either.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:20.95,0:17:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We were talking about whether I could be Senjougahara-senpai's replacement.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:26.43,0:17:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:27.38,0:17:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't change subjects before stating it clearly!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:30.77,0:17:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you wearing them, or aren't you?!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:34.30,0:17:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it clearly!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:36.16,0:17:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not concern ourselves with such vulgar details, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:40.05,0:17:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trivial matter.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:41.28,0:17:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell it is!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:42.66,0:17:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the difference between my underclassman being a sports girl or an exhibitionist!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 3,0:17:49.16,0:17:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you think of if this way:
Dialogue: 3,0:17:51.71,0:17:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She's both a sports girl and an exhibitionist.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:55.65,0:17:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For someone who believes she's a sports girl, she is a sports girl,
Dialogue: 3,0:17:58.91,0:18:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and for someone who believes she's an exhibitionist, she's an exhibitionist.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play with words!
Dialogue: 3,0:18:04.45,0:18:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's both A and B.{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:18:06.47,0:18:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For someone who believes it's A, it's A,{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:18:08.35,0:18:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and for someone who believes it's B, it's B.{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:18:11.60,0:18:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only cool until middle school!
Dialogue: 3,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you my little sister or something?!
Dialogue: 3,0:18:16.55,0:18:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But seriously, Kanbaru, no matter how hard you try,
Dialogue: 3,0:18:21.20,0:18:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you can never be a replacement for Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:25.28,0:18:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:28.01,0:18:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for someone to replace someone else.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:31.58,0:18:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like it's impossible for someone to {\i1}become{\i0} someone else.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:34.34,0:18:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you like them...
Dialogue: 3,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you adore them.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:38.07,0:18:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:39.37,0:18:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as you said.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:41.24,0:18:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:42.36,0:18:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's stop with the idle talk and get going already.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:02.50,0:19:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 3,0:19:04.56,0:19:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,what was with that girl?
Dialogue: 3,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She was super cute!
Dialogue: 3,0:19:08.08,0:19:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does that give you the biggest smile you've had all day?
Dialogue: 3,0:19:11.05,0:19:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hug her.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:11.85,0:19:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I want her to hug me!
Dialogue: 3,0:19:14.26,0:19:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But anyway, you're better off not getting involved with {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:20.28,0:19:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late, Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 3,0:19:22.56,0:19:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so tired of waiting that I was about to fall asleep.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:26.50,0:19:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 3,0:19:28.09,0:19:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you brought yet a different girl today.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:31.06,0:19:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring a different girl every time I see you.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:34.56,0:19:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:36.73,0:19:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:37.68,0:19:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop saying the same thing every time I come.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:39.61,0:19:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I saw Shinobu on the stairway.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:42.38,0:19:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing out there?
Dialogue: 3,0:19:44.75,0:19:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she sulked off when I ate one of the donuts from Mister Donut.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:51.36,0:19:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been like that since yesterday.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of vampire is she?
Dialogue: 3,0:19:55.68,0:19:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino, this is Kanbaru Suruga, one year behind me in school.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:59.32,0:20:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanbaru{\i0} is written with the characters {\i1}god{\i0} and {\i1}plains{\i0}.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:04.64,0:20:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,As for {\i1}Suruga{\i0}, um...
Dialogue: 3,0:20:06.45,0:20:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}Suruga{\i0} from {\i1}Japanese bondage torture.{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:08.43,0:20:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Japanese bondage torture, huh?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:10.52,0:20:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, got it.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:12.23,0:20:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Araragi-senpai's underclassman. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:15.62,0:20:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:17.02,0:20:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oshino Meme, miss.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:20.51,0:20:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're his underclassman, then you should also be an underclassman of that tsundere girl, am I right?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:26.11,0:20:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino, anyway, I'll start off by giving this to you.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:29.95,0:20:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from that tsundere girl, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:32.62,0:20:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, money.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:34.76,0:20:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Money, money...
Dialogue: 3,0:20:35.93,0:20:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:37.33,0:20:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just about to start affecting my lifestyle.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:40.62,0:20:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's up with that young lady?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:44.63,0:20:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's those bandages, isn't it?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:48.64,0:20:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino-san, I'm...
Dialogue: 3,0:20:51.43,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start from the beginning.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:53.27,0:20:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really seem to be an enjoyable story.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:55.81,0:20:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stories about arms never are.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:58.85,0:21:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's especially true in my case, and all the more if it's the left arm.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:06.65,0:21:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take off the bandages and let me see it, miss?
Dialogue: 3,0:21:09.68,0:21:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:15.66,0:21:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this good enough?
Dialogue: 3,0:21:20.04,0:21:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, it is.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:21.85,0:21:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, just as I thought.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:23.93,0:21:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, and you too, miss... let me clear something up for you:
Dialogue: 3,0:21:29.36,0:21:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your left hand{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}that's not a monkey's paw.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:33.33,0:21:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 3,0:21:35.08,0:21:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The monkey's paw assimilating with the owner
Dialogue: 3,0:21:38.71,0:21:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,is something that I've never heard of.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:41.07,0:21:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, your hand was originally mummified, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:21:44.63,0:21:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If that has gained life by assimilating with you,
Dialogue: 3,0:21:48.43,0:21:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'd say for the time being that it's probably the {\i1}Rainy Devil.{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:51.05,0:21:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rainy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:52.06,0:21:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a low-level demon.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:55.03,0:21:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you narrow that group down to ones that have a monkey's arms and wear a raincoat,
Dialogue: 3,0:21:58.75,0:22:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the number necessarily decreases quite a bit.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:01.27,0:22:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one that assimilates with the owner is the {\i1}Rainy Devil.{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:05.38,0:22:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a monkey's paw{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}it's a demon's hand.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:08.30,0:22:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it will grant you anything you wish for...
Dialogue: 3,0:22:11.03,0:22:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, after all, it's a trade for your soul.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:13.87,0:22:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul?
Dialogue: 3,0:22:16.37,0:22:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for taking your soul it grants you three wishes.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:20.49,0:22:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:22.46,0:22:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,For demons, that is...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:55.75,0:23:56.44,Default,O,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:56.45,0:23:57.21,Default,O,0,0,0,,And I'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:58.79,Default,O,0,0,0,,Tsukihi-chan, you're in the tea club, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:24:00.53,Default,O,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am the tea club!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.61,0:24:03.44,Default,O,0,0,0,,Well then, do you know what type of tea they use in Uji city in Kyoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:04.47,Default,O,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.47,0:24:07.13,Default,O,0,0,0,, In Uji they have tea on tap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.13,0:24:07.91,Default,O,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.91,0:24:11.29,Default,O,0,0,0,,By the way, a tap and a jacuzzi resemble each other in the position of their names, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:12.98,Default,O,0,0,0,,You're well-versed in discussing Uji City.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:12.98,0:24:13.82,Default,O,0,0,0,,It's preview quiz!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:13.82,0:24:14.36,Default,O,0,0,0,,Quiz!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:14.36,0:24:15.43,Default,O,0,0,0,,Preview Izu!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:15.43,0:24:16.01,Default,O,0,0,0,,Izu?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:16.01,0:24:16.84,Default,O,0,0,0,,Izu is a riddle!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:16.84,0:24:18.01,Default,O,0,0,0,,Izu is a riddle?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:18.47,0:24:20.47,Default,O,0,0,0,,Next time, "Suruga Monkey", Part Three!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:20.47,0:24:21.81,Default,O,0,0,0,,Izu is a quiz!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:21.81,0:24:22.47,Default,O,0,0,0,,Enigmatic!
